+Click the voltage readout at the bottom of the homepage (initially `5.0V`) to open `/secret/`. Circular, Schematic Maker (`/cad-machining/`), Upload, and Abyss (`/kalman/`) appear as cards that open their projects in new tabs. The voltage slider remains independent of the link.
+
+## Abyss Kalman field notebook
+
+Open `/kalman/` for a standalone robotics activity: seeded depth missions, a two-state linear Kalman filter, noise tuning, identical-data comparison, and a guided predict/correct notebook. It uses local HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and SVG with no build, backend, or CDN. Run `node tests/kalman-preview.cjs` and visit `http://localhost:8311/kalman/`. Run `node --test tests/*.test.cjs` for numerical and existing-site regressions. See [DELIVERY.md](DELIVERY.md) for verification and model limits.
 
